sort [cntrycode asc]
└─ project (cntrycode, numcust, totacctbal) (rows≈1 cost≈9.7K)
   └─ aggregate keys=[custsale.cntrycode] aggs=[count_0=count, sum_1=sum] (rows≈1 cost≈9.7K)
      └─ project (custsale.cntrycode, custsale.c_acctbal) (rows≈1 cost≈9.6K)
         └─ join inner residual (> |customer.c_acctbal| __scalar_0__) (rows≈1 cost≈9.6K)
            ├─ join left_anti [customer.c_custkey = orders.o_custkey] (rows≈1 cost≈4.8K)
            │  ├─ filter (call qdb_in_list (call qdb_substring |customer.c_phone| (cast 1 i32) (cast 2 i32)) (cast "27" <named StringView>) (cast "20" <named StringView>) (cast "22" <named StringView>) (cast "34" <named StringView>) (cast "29" <named StringView>) (cast "23" <named StringView>) (cast "17" <named StringView>)) (rows≈5 cost≈560)
            │  │  └─ source customer AS customer row-groups (call qdb_in_list (call qdb_substring |customer.c_phone| (cast 1 i32) (cast 2 i32)) (cast "27" <named StringView>) (cast "20" <named StringView>) (cast "22" <named StringView>) (cast "34" <named StringView>) (cast "29" <named StringView>) (cast "23" <named StringView>) (cast "17" <named StringView>)) (rows≈10 cost≈280)
            │  └─ source orders AS orders (rows≈10 cost≈40)
            └─ project (__scalar_0__) (rows≈1 cost≈688)
               └─ aggregate keys=[__group__] aggs=[sum_0=sum, count_1=count] (rows≈1 cost≈680)
                  └─ project (customer_1.c_acctbal, __group__) (rows≈5 cost≈560)
                     └─ filter (&& (> |customer_1.c_acctbal| 0.0) (call qdb_in_list (call qdb_substring |customer_1.c_phone| (cast 1 i32) (cast 2 i32)) (cast "27" <named StringView>) (cast "20" <named StringView>) (cast "22" <named StringView>) (cast "34" <named StringView>) (cast "29" <named StringView>) (cast "23" <named StringView>) (cast "17" <named StringView>))) (rows≈5 cost≈480)
                        └─ source customer AS customer_1 row-groups (&& (> |customer_1.c_acctbal| 0.0) (call qdb_in_list (call qdb_substring |customer_1.c_phone| (cast 1 i32) (cast 2 i32)) (cast "27" <named StringView>) (cast "20" <named StringView>) (cast "22" <named StringView>) (cast "34" <named StringView>) (cast "29" <named StringView>) (cast "23" <named StringView>) (cast "17" <named StringView>))) (rows≈10 cost≈240)
